  "body": "**Shorts** — a new tab with a full-screen vertical feed of YouTube Shorts.\n\n- Your own Shorts feed when signed in, a general one when signed out.\n- Swipe between shorts; tap to pause. The tab bar turns into a frosted-glass bar with back, like, comments, share and the channel (subscribe or go to the channel).\n- No waiting: the next shorts are loaded ahead, and the next 10 unseen ones are kept downloaded (about 100–150 MB of cache), so they start instantly even right after opening the app.\n- Your regular video pauses while you're in Shorts and carries on when you leave.\n\nThanks to @essopsp for the idea of a Shorts tab (#10).\n\nInstall Skipii.apk on Android (allow installs from your browser or file manager).",
